# Normalise text to LF inside the repository. Working copies on Windows still
# get native endings on checkout.
* text=auto eol=lf

# API response fixtures are compared byte-for-byte against SHA-256 checksums
# recorded in tests/fixtures/MANIFEST.json. Git must never rewrite a byte of
# them, or the checksum test fails on a Linux runner for a reason that has
# nothing to do with the data.
#
# Today's cached responses happen to contain no newline bytes at all, so
# nothing would be converted. That is luck rather than design: a season whose
# responses arrive pretty-printed would break silently. Marking them binary
# makes the guarantee explicit instead of accidental.
tests/fixtures/games/**/*.json -text
